; TLink relocation-site overhang fixes the starts after S0941 and S0B17.
; Relocated far pointers with target offset zero establish these segment bases.
; The other code-class segment maps still have gaps whose code/data roles are
; not fully classified by the current two-second coverage run.
; Verified instruction starts from the deterministic two-second runner
; coverage, recorded only at the first address of each reached gap.
; The assembler choices at the raw hints below are required for an identical
; rebuild.

relocorder original

